      "id": "claim_6044fe562d7c48e786f89ed90c62243f",
      "statement": "The default release uploader is a Node native HTTPS uploader that bypasses the proxy, streams files, caches the release `upload_url` per tag, obtains its token from `gh auth token` without logging it, and implements clobber by deleting and re-uploading on a 422; `PICTELIO_UPLOADER=gh` restores the gh subprocess, and `probeProxyRouting` prints whether the run goes direct or through a proxy (ADR-0067).",
